		"description": "<p>You may consume one wondrous magic item of your choosing. This item may not be legendary or an artifact, and it cannot be sentient.</p><p>Once you have consumed an item in this fashion, you gain an additional attunement slot that is dedicated to that item. This attunement lasts until you consume another wondrous item, at which point the original magic item is destroyed and its attunement is replaced with the new item.</p>",
